flowchart TD
  S([Start]) --> R[Citizen registers / logs in]
  R --> L[Link MetaMask wallet by signing a message]
  L --> F[Fill recycling form + optional photo]
  F --> V{Valid input?}
  V -- No --> F
  V -- Yes --> P[Submission saved as PENDING]
  P --> AR[Administrator reviews evidence]
  AR --> D{Approve?}
  D -- No --> RJ[Reject with reason, citizen notified]
  RJ --> E1([End])
  D -- Yes --> AP[Status APPROVED]
  AP --> W{Citizen wallet linked?}
  W -- No --> NW[Ask citizen to link wallet] --> W
  W -- Yes --> CK{Already rewarded on-chain?}
  CK -- Yes --> STOP[Block: duplicate] --> E2([End])
  CK -- No --> SG[Admin signs reward transaction in MetaMask]
  SG --> TX{Transaction confirmed and verified?}
  TX -- No --> FL[Reward FAILED, admin may retry] --> CK
  TX -- Yes --> OK[Reward CONFIRMED, citizen notified]
  OK --> E3([End])
